title: "Verified constructions, a classification programme, and conditional reductions for Gallai's path decomposition conjecture"
authors:
  - name: "Independent Researcher"
    email: 672178818@qq.com
year: 2026
date-released: 2026-10-13
type: article
message: "Preprint, 60 pages. Paper text released under CC BY 4.0; repository code and scripts under MIT."
license: MIT
abstract: "The paper is a self-contained study organised around exact constructions, a classification programme, and conditional reductions for Gallai's path decomposition conjecture (1966): the edges of every connected graph on n vertices can be decomposed into at most ceil(n/2) paths."
keywords:
  - graph theory
  - path decomposition
  - Gallai's conjecture
  - Lean formalization
